{
    "title": "Lyrical Mayhem Twiddle Finger",
    "description": "Get ready to dive into Friday Night Showdown - a funky musical adventure with Lyrical Mayhem vs Twiddle Finger! Boyfriend and Girlfriend are up against new foes \r\n(Twiddle Finger, Silly Billy, Rotten Smoothie) in an electrifying series of rap battles that will push your skills to the limit.\r\n\r\nIn this mod, you'll play as BF and GF with appearances from the Funky universe through catchy tunes and challenging levels, each designed to test your rhythm and timing. Twiddle Finger brings a whole new vibe to the game, with fresh tracks and dynamic stages that make every battle feel like a brand-new experience.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n- Go head-to-head with Twiddle Finger in intense musical showdowns, packed with original tracks and beats.\r\n- Explore vibrant, animated stages that add an extra layer of excitement to the gameplay.\r\n- Perfect your timing and reflexes to hit every note and emerge victorious in the rap battles.\r\n- Enjoy a fresh soundtrack that brings new rhythms and challenges to each battle.\r\n\r\nHow to Play:\r\n- Choose your difficulty level and select the Lyrical Mayhem mod.\r\n- Follow the on-screen arrows that match the rhythm of the music.\r\n- Press the corresponding keys to hit the notes accurately and keep the rhythm going.\r\n- Win the battle by hitting more notes correctly than your opponent and keeping your health bar full.\r\n- Progress through the mod to face off against Twiddle Finger and conquer all the levels.\r\n\r\nDownload now and prove you've got what it takes to defeat Twiddle Finger and claim victory in this musical mayhem!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get ready to dive into Friday Night Showdown - a funky musical adventure with Lyrical Mayhem vs Twiddle Finger! Boyfriend and Girlfriend are up against new foes <br>(Twiddle Finger, Silly Billy, Rotten Smoothie) in an electrifying series of rap battles that will push your skills to the limit.<br><br>In this mod, you&#39;ll play as BF and GF with appearances from the Funky universe through catchy tunes and challenging levels, each designed to test your rhythm and timing. Twiddle Finger brings a whole new vibe to the game, with fresh tracks and dynamic stages that make every battle feel like a brand-new experience.<br><br>Key Features:<br>- Go head-to-head with Twiddle Finger in intense musical showdowns, packed with original tracks and beats.<br>- Explore vibrant, animated stages that add an extra layer of excitement to the gameplay.<br>- Perfect your timing and reflexes to hit every note and emerge victorious in the rap battles.<br>- Enjoy a fresh soundtrack that brings new rhythms and challenges to each battle.<br><br>How to Play:<br>- Choose your difficulty level and select the Lyrical Mayhem mod.<br>- Follow the on-screen arrows that match the rhythm of the music.<br>- Press the corresponding keys to hit the notes accurately and keep the rhythm going.<br>- Win the battle by hitting more notes correctly than your opponent and keeping your health bar full.<br>- Progress through the mod to face off against Twiddle Finger and conquer all the levels.<br><br>Download now and prove you&#39;ve got what it takes to defeat Twiddle Finger and claim victory in this musical mayhem!",
